<Base {title} {description} lang="en" altPath="privacy"><section class="section"><article class="shell legal max-w-4xl"><h1 class="section-title">Privacy policy</h1><p>Reviewed: 23 October 2026</p><h2>Technical contact and service providers</h2><p>The hosting service may receive technical data such as your IP address, browser and the URL you requested, in order to serve the site and keep it secure. The browser-side weather refresh contacts Open-Meteo directly; the forecast is also taken from the same provider at build time. When an embedded map loads, or when you open a map link, your browser contacts Google and Google’s terms apply. Images are served from this site itself.</p><h2>Google Analytics and withdrawing consent</h2><p>The Google Analytics identity is G-HXM22WWPKP. Analytics only turns on after your choice has been successfully written to local storage and read back for confirmation. When you turn it off, analytics is stopped on this page immediately, even if writing to storage fails. If the write fails, another page or your next visit may read the earlier permission; the control states this limit.</p><h2>Local data and offline copies</h2><p>Your analytics choice is kept in localStorage. The forecast cache lasts at most 30 minutes, and the provider time is also checked. A service worker may keep copies of successfully loaded pages and resources for offline use. Old copies are not evidence of current operations. You can remove them by clearing site data in your browser.</p><h2>Independent measurement by the host</h2><p>Cloudflare hosting may provide security, technical logs or performance measurement beacons according to its configuration. The Google Analytics control does not change these independent services. The presence of any script is not by itself evidence that data is collected. See Cloudflare’s original data-collection documentation below.</p><h2>Rights and limits</h2><p>This site has no purchase or account-registration form. Each external service’s policy applies to its own data collection and retention. Under applicable law, rights depend on the relevant data controller and the circumstances.</p><p><a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie settings</a> · <a href="/en/">Main guide</a></p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-origin-and-collection/">Cloudflare data collection</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo terms</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a></p></article></section></Base>
